   "stem_html": "Approximately 15.8 percent of U.S. residents are age 65 and older.\n<ol type=\"a\">\n<li>Which of the five states listed have a percentage of residents age 65 and older greater than 15.8 percent?</li>\n<li>Which of the five states listed have a percentage of residents age 65 and older less than 15.8 percent?</li>\n<li>Explain the correlation.</li>\n</ol>",
